{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791124100,"nonce":"Eymi0yVJ5NQwDFKIEPzSv4i3JLY=","title":"Embed's registry rebuild drops frontend type metadata (EXACT_STRUCT_KEY)","message":"zyntax_embed lower.rs lower_typed_program rebuilds the type registry from TypedDeclaration::Class declarations with a fresh TypeMetadata (only is_reference from the @reference annotation), replacing a definition the frontend registered itself. Custom metadata the frontend set is lost: Python's EXACT_STRUCT_KEY on its classes (zyntax_python lib.rs ~1139), which exact_struct_types reads after the rebuild, so exactness may never reach licm/load_cse for those types. M2 carries the header-free mark through the rebuild and nothing else; carrying all of metadata.custom changes Python optimization and needs its own A/B and conformance run.","files":null}]}